msgstr ""
"将 DrawableTexture 初始化为一张指定 [param width]（宽度）、[param height]（高"
"度）和 [param format]（格式）的白色纹理。"

msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format RGBA with four components, each with a bitdepth of 8."
msgstr "一种具有四个分量的 OpenGL 纹理格式 RGBA，每个分量的位深度均为 8 位。"

msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format RGBA with four components, each with a bitdepth of 8.\n"
"When drawn to, an sRGB to linear color space conversion is performed."
msgstr ""
"一种具有四个分量、每个分量位深度均为 8 位的 OpenGL RGBA 纹理格式。\n"
"当向其进行绘制时，会执行从 sRGB 到线性颜色空间的转换。"

msgid ""
